  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_3567.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Kids&amp;Us Onda, school of english, en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9, ha acogido este s&aacute;bado dos nuevas sesiones de The genuine Little Chef, en las que ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as a partir de 3 a&ntilde;os, sus madres y un padre han aprendido a cocinar banana sushi en ingl&eacute;s, con una profesora nativa, y la colaboraci&oacute;n de Celia Navarro Gil, directora del centro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3565.jpg\" alt=\"img_3565\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3566.jpg\" alt=\"img_3566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3567.jpg\" alt=\"img_3567\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3568.jpg\" alt=\"img_3568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3569.jpg\" alt=\"img_3569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3570.jpg\" alt=\"img_3570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3571.jpg\" alt=\"img_3571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/littlechefmarckidsampusonda/img_3572.jpg\" alt=\"img_3572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb